<title>USA: Empi Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Empi Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.29		   $ 0.25</p>
<p> Net			  2,407		    2,237</p>
<p> Revs			18,025		   16,892</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,369		    8,966</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 comparisons were impacted by about $0.02/shr due to an unfavorable one-time severance charge in 1997 and favorable one-time litigation settlement credit to earnings in the 1996 Q1.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
